    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-1-4",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化簡至最簡根式：$\\frac{\\sqrt{50}+\\sqrt{32}}{\\sqrt2}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "矩形的周長為 $28$ cm，若長比寬多 $2$ cm，則此矩形的對角線長＝＿＿＿＿cm。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-3",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知坐標平面上的兩點 $A(-2,7)$ 和 $B(3,3)$，則 $\\overline{AB}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-4",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\triangle ABC$ 中，若 $\\angle ABC=90^\\circ$，$\\overline{AB}=3$、$\\overline{AC}=4$，且 $\\overline{BD}$ 為 $\\triangle ABC$ 斜邊上的高，求 $\\overline{BD}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-5-1",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$4x^2+12x=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-5-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$(2x-3)(3x+1)-(2x-3)(2x+3)=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
