  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-9",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $6x^2-ax-2$ 與 $3x^2-8x+b$ 有共同的因式 $3x-2$，則 $a+b=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-10",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解 $5(4x^2-9)-3(4x^2+12x+9)=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-11",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "有一矩形的長、寬分別為 $ax+b$ 及 $cx-d$，面積為 $12x^2-19x-21$，其中 $a$、$b$、$c$、$d$ 皆為正整數，則 $a+b+c+d=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-12",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $4x^2-3x-10$ 為質數，則此時 $x=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2",
    "sourceNote": "原稿未明列x為整數；忠實保留原題條件，未自行補入。"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-112-1-2-8-fill-13",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $2x^2+x-6$ 與 $2x^2-x+a$ 有公因式，則 $a=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "7b7993d35c10493b1f05c2ff079fcd5faa496b304bb85336886c139fe24192b2"
  },
  {
